# Production build values for crewapply.com.
#
# COMMITTED ON PURPOSE. Anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the
# browser bundle at BUILD time, so it is public by definition — there is no
# secret here to leak. Committing it removes the single most likely deployment
# failure: building on the server without this file, which silently bakes in the
# localhost fallback from app.constants.js and ships a site whose every API call
# goes to a machine the visitor does not have.
#
# Because it is baked in at build time, changing it requires a REBUILD, not a
# restart.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.crewapply.com/api/v1
